dy and drain cells of glycogen, the energy stores that power your muscles."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Genius Electrolytes contains Sustamine, a clinically tested ingredient that combines the amino acids L-Glutamine and L-Alanine to assist with amplifying your body's hydration process. Hydrate the Smart Way!"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Mix one scoop of Genius Electrolytes in 8 fl oz of cold water or your favorite beverage. Drink during physical activity to sustain efficient muscle function and/or drink throughout the day for optimal hydration."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult a health care practitioner prior to use if you are taking prescription medication or if you have a serious medical condition or if you are pregnant or breastfeeding."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"TRAACS\nSustamine Rehydrate. Replenish. Recover.\nSustamine is a registered trademark of Kyowa Hakko Bio Co., Ltd."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"300mg of Sustamine"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No artificial sweeteners or dyes"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Performance Optimizing Hydration Booster"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"100% Naturally Flavored and Sweetened Orange Fizz"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Manufactured in a facility which may also process milk, soy, wheat, egg, pe